issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111212","id":3605682061,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7W6leN","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-03T08:39:20Z","updated_at":"2025-12-03T08:39:20Z","body":"How does it break compatibility?\r\nThe inheritance changed from ConfirmationDialog -> EditorFileDialog to ConfirmationDialog -> FileDialog -> EditorFileDialog. The EditorFileDialog has still the same base class (just higher in hierarchy), the \"removed\" methods are now part of parent class. Everything is the same.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3605682061/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3606148732","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111212#issuecomment-3606148732","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111212","id":3606148732,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7W8XZ8","user":{"login":"nikitalita","id":69168929,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5MTY4OTI5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69168929?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita","html_url":"https://github.com/nikitalita","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-03T10:29:42Z","updated_at":"2025-12-03T10:30:20Z","body":"The method hashes changed, so getting the method bind fails:\r\n\r\n```\r\nERROR: Method 'EditorFileDialog.set_file_mode' has changed and no compatibility fallback has been provided. Please open an issue.\r\n   at: gdextension_classdb_get_method_bind (core/extension/gdextension_interface.cpp:1643)\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3606148732/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3606416387","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111212#issuecomment-3606416387","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111212","id":3606416387,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7W9YwD","user":{"login":"Bromeon","id":708488,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwODQ4OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/708488?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Bromeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-03T11:30:07Z","updated_at":"2025-12-03T11:37:40Z","body":"> This breaks GDExtension compatibility\r\n\r\nI can confirm this. At least the following method cannot be found, possibly more:\r\n```\r\nEditorFileDialog::set_file_mode (hash 274150415).\r\n```\r\n\r\nIt looks like the methods seem to be exposed from the `FileDialog` base class:\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/7a228b4b9126d218425cb20b4846963b2dae489c/scene/gui/file_dialog.cpp#L2024\r\n\r\nI wonder if something with the derived->base fallback mechanism is not working?\r\nMaybe the hash is different now, because `EditorFileDialog::FileMode` != `FileDialog::FileMode`?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3606416387/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3606451503","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111212#issuecomment-3606451503","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111212","id":3606451503,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7W9hUv","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-03T11:39:52Z","updated_at":"2025-12-03T11:39:52Z","body":"There are more methods that have changed to a different enum (`set_access()`, `set_display_mode()`), so it would be weird if only one of them posed problems.\r\nThe \"new\" enum has the same name and the same constants, it's just from different class.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3606451503/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3606617919","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111212#issuecomment-3606617919","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111212","id":3606617919,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7W-J8_","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","a